佩查拉（Treechada Petcharat）。（IG@poydtreechada）</figcaption></figure><p>人行道驚現「耶穌臉」！巴西小鎮掀朝聖潮 信徒跪地痛哭</p><p>空污不只傷肺還傷腦 研究：PM2.5高暴露者失智風險增14%</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T05:40:41.706879+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2222,"images":23,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T05:30:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T09:18:34.510967+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T05:38:11.999243+00:00","content_hash":"28c152b3cc98c5a7db2a3c3093452afe951059b1c0ea251c502255c96f2d8ff5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}